1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Everyone, strum your koras,

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
strike the balafons.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
The red lion has roared.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
The tamer of the savannah

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,555
has leapt forward,

6
00:00:15,555 --> 00:00:18,555
dispelling the darkness.

7
00:00:18,555 --> 00:00:22,000
Sunlight on our terrors, sunlight on our hope.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Stand up, brothers, here is Africa assembled.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Fibers of my green heart,

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Shoulder to shoulder, 

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,300
my more-than-brothers,

12
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,400
O Senegalese, arise!

13
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:42,000
Join the sea and the springs!

14
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Join the steppe and the forest!

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Hail mother Africa!